{% comment %}
  本季主推专题页(#131,page.season 模板):首页「本季主推」入口卡点进来的一页。版式按 Figma「02 季节主推」画布（2026-10-16 用户指定）。
  杂志式:开头为刊名 + 大标题 + 导语 + 封面大图，下方一排带小图的目录;每款毛线一段，3 张成品图（1 大 2 小）与介绍左右交替;商品资料排成细线规格表。
  选品:优先用「选品列表」（按列表顺序）；列表为空时，取所选集合（留空用 毛线 集合）里带指定标签的商品（前 50 件中取前 N 件）。
  标签只用于选品,不显示在页面上,也不出现「爆款」「热销」等字样。
  每款介绍:有同一商品的「毛线介绍」block 时用 block 三语文案与配图（上传图优先，其次 block 里填的 Theme 素材文件名，都没有时用商品主图）。
  介绍下方放首页商品卡的横排版（yarn-pick-card layout: 'row'，用户 2026-10-16 在 Figma 整体效果候选中选定 E），名称、规格、价格只取 Shopify，整卡进入商品页;专题页不直接加购，也不显示色样（商品没有颜色规格）。
  三语文案经 yarn-setting-text 取:纯键名为日文默认,_zh/_en 为中英设置;通用按钮用 Theme locales。
  画布图片的来源见 docs/design/approved/131-season-canvas.source.md。
  #181 手机版（2026-10-17 用户确认 Figma「02 本季主推专题 · 手机重设计 · 390」）：封面满屏、目录竖排；成品图满屏宽 1 大 2 小、大图左右交替。
  成品图每张都是按钮，点开 yarn-season-lightbox 全屏看大图（滑动 / ‹ › / 缩略图切换，✕、Esc、下滑关闭），大图用 data-full 的高清地址。
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign sp_collection = section.settings.collection | default: collections['yarn']
  assign sp_tag = section.settings.tag | strip
  assign sp_handles = ''
  if section.settings.products != blank
    for sp_product in section.settings.products
      assign sp_handles = sp_handles | append: sp_product.handle | append: ','
    endfor
  elsif sp_collection != blank
    for sp_product in sp_collection.products limit: 50
      if sp_tag == blank or sp_product.tags contains sp_tag
        assign sp_handles = sp_handles | append: sp_product.handle | append: ','
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign sp_handles = sp_handles | split: ','
  assign sp_count = sp_handles.size
  if sp_count > section.settings.products_to_show
    assign sp_count = section.settings.products_to_show
  endif
  assign sp_last = sp_count | minus: 1
  capture sp_eyebrow
    render 'yarn-setting-text', settings: section.settings, key: 'eyebrow'
  endcapture
  capture sp_heading
    render 'yarn-setting-text', settings: section.settings, key: 'heading'
  endcapture
  capture sp_text
    render 'yarn-setting-text', settings: section.settings, key: 'text'
  endcapture
  if sp_heading == blank
    assign sp_heading = page.title
  endif
-%}
{{ 'yarn-cards.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'yarn-season-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<article class="yx-season-page">
  <header class="yx-season-page__cover">
    <div class="yx-season-page__art{% if section.settings.image == blank and section.settings.cover_asset == blank and section.settings.source_image == false %} yx-season-page__art--mosaic{% endif %}">
      {%- if section.settings.image != blank -%}
        {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 2000 | image_tag: widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1600, 2000', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 55vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: '' }}
      {%- elsif section.settings.cover_asset != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ section.settings.cover_asset | strip | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="896" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="">
      {%- elsif section.settings.source_image -%}
        <img src="{{ 'hitoami-source-oil-loop.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="790" height="885" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="">
      {%- else -%}
        {%- for sp_at in (0..sp_last) limit: 4 -%}
          {%- assign sp_cover = all_products[sp_handles[sp_at]].featured_image -%}
          {%- if sp_cover != blank -%}
            {%- if forloop.first -%}{%- assign sp_w = 1200 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sp_w = 600 -%}{%- endif -%}
            {{ sp_cover | image_url: width: sp_w | image_tag: widths: '300, 600, 900, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 30vw, 50vw', loading: 'eager', alt: '' }}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="yx-season-page__intro">
      {%- if sp_eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="yx-season-page__eyebrow">{{ sp_eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="yx-season-page__heading">{{ sp_heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h1>
      {%- if sp_text != blank -%}<p class="yx-season-page__text">{{ sp_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- if sp_count > 1 -%}
      <nav class="yx-season-page__toc" aria-label="{{ 'yarn_project.season_contents' | t }}">
        <ol>
          {%- for sp_at in (0..sp_last) -%}
            {%- assign sp_item = all_products[sp_handles[sp_at]] -%}
            {%- assign sp_thumb = sp_item.metafields.yarn.card_image.value | default: sp_item.featured_image -%}
            <li>
              <a href="#SeasonYarn-{{ forloop.index }}">
                <span class="yx-season-page__toc-thumb">
                  {%- if sp_thumb != blank -%}{{ sp_thumb | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: widths: '120, 240', sizes: '96px', loading: 'eager', alt: '' }}{%- endif -%}
                </span>
                <span class="yx-season-page__toc-num">{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</span>
                <span class="yx-season-page__toc-name">{{ sp_item.title | escape }}</span>
                <svg class="yx-season-page__toc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ol>
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  {%- if sp_count == 0 -%}
    <p class="yx-season-page__empty">{{ 'yarn_project.catalog_preparing' | t }}</p>
    {%- if request.design_mode -%}<p class="yx-season-page__empty">本季主推：所选集合里没有带「{{ sp_tag | escape }}」标签的商品。</p>{%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    <ol class="yx-season-page__list">
      {%- for sp_at in (0..sp_last) -%}
        {%- assign sp_item = all_products[sp_handles[sp_at]] -%}
        {%- assign sp_note = blank -%}
        {%- assign sp_lead = blank -%}
        {%- assign sp_block = blank -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.settings.product.handle == sp_item.handle -%}
            {%- assign sp_block = block -%}
            {%- capture sp_note -%}{%- render 'yarn-setting-text', settings: block.settings, key: 'note' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            {%- capture sp_lead -%}{%- render 'yarn-setting-text', settings: block.settings, key: 'lead' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- comment -%} 3 个图位：每个图位先用 block 上传图，其次 block 填的 Theme 素材文件名（逗号分隔，按图位顺序）。{%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign sp_assets = sp_block.settings.assets | remove: ' ' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- capture sp_gallery -%}
          {%- for sp_slot in (1..3) -%}
            {%- assign sp_slot_at = sp_slot | minus: 1 -%}
            {%- if sp_slot == 1 -%}{%- assign sp_pick = sp_block.settings.image -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sp_key = 'image_' | append: sp_slot -%}{%- assign sp_pick = sp_block.settings[sp_key] -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if sp_slot == 1 -%}{%- assign sp_w = 1200 -%}{%- assign sp_sizes = '(min-width: 750px) 34vw, 61vw' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sp_w = 800 -%}{%- assign sp_sizes = '(min-width: 750px) 23vw, 39vw' -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign sp_full = blank -%}
            {%- assign sp_fallback = blank -%}
            {%- capture sp_img -%}
              {%- if sp_pick != blank -%}
                {{ sp_pick | image_url: width: sp_w | image_tag: widths: '400, 600, 800, 1200', sizes: sp_sizes, loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
              {%- elsif sp_assets[sp_slot_at] != blank -%}
                <img src="{{ sp_assets[sp_slot_at] | asset_url }}" width="640" height="853" loading="lazy" alt="">
              {%- elsif sp_slot == 1 -%}
                {%- assign sp_fallback = sp_item.metafields.yarn.card_image.value | default: sp_item.featured_image -%}
                {%- if sp_fallback != blank -%}{{ sp_fallback | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: widths: '400, 600, 900, 1200', sizes: sp_sizes, loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endcapture -%}
            {%- if sp_pick != blank -%}
              {%- assign sp_full = sp_pick | image_url: width: 2000 -%}
            {%- elsif sp_assets[sp_slot_at] != blank -%}
              {%- assign sp_full = sp_assets[sp_slot_at] | asset_url -%}
            {%- elsif sp_slot == 1 and sp_fallback != blank -%}
              {%- assign sp_full = sp_fallback | image_url: width: 2000 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if sp_full != blank -%}
              <button type="button" class="yx-season-page__shot" data-full="{{ sp_full }}" aria-label="{{ 'yarn_project.season_photo_open' | t: name: sp_item.title, index: sp_slot, total: '__SHOTS__' | escape }}">{{ sp_img }}{%- if sp_slot == 1 -%}<span class="yx-season-page__zoom" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false"><path d="M9.5 2.5h4v4M13.5 2.5 9 7M6.5 13.5h-4v-4M2.5 13.5 7 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>1/__SHOTS__</span>{%- endif -%}</button>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endcapture -%}
        {%- assign sp_shots = sp_gallery | split: 'yx-season-page__shot"' | size | minus: 1 -%}
        {%- assign sp_num = forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 -%}
        {%- assign sp_mod = forloop.index | modulo: 2 -%}
        <li class="yx-season-page__yarn{% if sp_mod == 0 %} yx-season-page__yarn--flip{% endif %}" id="SeasonYarn-{{ forloop.index }}">
          <figure class="yx-season-page__figure">
            <div class="yx-season-page__media yx-season-page__media--{{ sp_shots | at_least: 1 | at_most: 3 }}" data-season-gallery data-caption="{{ sp_item.title | escape }}">{{ sp_gallery | replace: '__SHOTS__', sp_shots }}</div>
            <figcaption class="visually-hidden">No.{{ sp_num }} — {{ sp_item.title | escape }}</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="yx-season-page__copy">
            <span class="yx-season-page__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ sp_num }}</span>
            <h2 class="yx-season-page__name"><a href="{{ sp_item.url }}">{{ sp_item.title | escape }}</a></h2>
            {%- if sp_lead != blank -%}<p class="yx-season-page__lead">{{ sp_lead | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if sp_note != blank -%}<p class="yx-season-page__note">{{ sp_note | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            <div class="yx-season-page__card">{%- render 'yarn-pick-card', card_product: sp_item, layout: 'row' -%}</div>
          </div>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
    <script src="{{ 'yarn-season-lightbox.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
    <yarn-season-lightbox>
      <dialog class="yx-lightbox" aria-label="{{ 'yarn_project.season_photo_viewer' | t }}">
        <div class="yx-lightbox__bar">
          <span class="yx-lightbox__count" data-count aria-live="polite"></span>
          <button type="button" class="yx-lightbox__close" data-close aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="yx-lightbox__track" data-track tabindex="-1"></div>
        <button type="button" class="yx-lightbox__step yx-lightbox__step--prev" data-step="-1" aria-label="{{ 'yarn_project.season_photo_prev' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" class="yx-lightbox__step yx-lightbox__step--next" data-step="1" aria-label="{{ 'yarn_project.season_photo_next' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        <div class="yx-lightbox__foot">
          <div class="yx-lightbox__thumbs" data-thumbs></div>
          <p class="yx-lightbox__caption" data-caption></p>
        </div>
      </dialog>
    </yarn-season-lightbox>
  {%- endif -%}
</article>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "本季主推专题",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section yx-season-page-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "source_image", "label": "使用本次油画圈圈线原图作为封面", "default": false },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "封面大图", "info": "未上传时依次用下面的 Theme 素材、油画圈圈线原图，或选品前 4 款毛线主图拼贴。" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cover_asset", "label": "封面 · Theme 素材文件名", "info": "例如 season-2026aw-cover.jpg；上传封面大图后不再使用。" },
    { "type": "product_list", "id": "products", "label": "选品列表", "limit": 12, "info": "按列表顺序显示；留空时按下面的集合与标签选品。" },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "选品集合", "info": "留空时使用「毛线」集合。" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tag", "label": "选品标签", "default": "预订爆款", "info": "选品列表为空时，只取集合里带这个标签的商品；标签不会显示在页面上。" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "products_to_show", "min": 2, "max": 12, "step": 1, "default": 7, "label": "最多显示几款" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "日文 · 刊名（目录旁）", "default": "今季の特集" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow_zh", "label": "中文 · 刊名（目录旁）", "default": "本季专题" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow_en", "label": "英文 · 刊名（目录旁）", "default": "This season's feature" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "label": "日文 · 标题", "default": "この季節、\n編みたい色。" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading_zh", "label": "中文 · 标题", "default": "这一季，\n想织的颜色" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading_en", "label": "英文 · 标题", "default": "This season,\nthe colours we want to knit" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "日文 · 导语", "default": "店で選んだ今季の毛糸。ひと玉ごとに、色の物語があります。" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "text_zh", "label": "中文 · 导语", "default": "店里挑的当季毛线，每一团都有自己的颜色故事。" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "text_en", "label": "英文 · 导语", "default": "Yarns we picked for the season, each with its own colour story." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "note",
      "name": "毛线介绍",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "毛线" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "成品图 1（大图）", "info": "未上传且未填 Theme 素材时用商品主图。" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_2", "label": "成品图 2" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_3", "label": "成品图 3" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "assets", "label": "Theme 素材文件名", "info": "按图位顺序用逗号分隔，例如 a.jpg,b.jpg,c.jpg；对应图位上传图片后不再使用。" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "lead", "label": "日文 · 引言" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "lead_zh", "label": "中文 · 引言" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "lead_en", "label": "英文 · 引言" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "note", "label": "日文 · 介绍" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "note_zh", "label": "中文 · 介绍" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "note_en", "label": "英文 · 介绍" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "本季主推专题" }]
}
{% endschema %}
